# ...except the one setup embeds. The engine smoke test compares a whole
# transcript against pinned ground truth, so the clip has to travel with the
# code that asserts on it. The previous fixture was gitignored, lived only in
# `.tools/`, and by 2026-08-18 had been lost from every checkout on this
# machine -- taking the proof with it. `scripts/New-SmokeFixture.ps1`
# regenerates this one from Windows' own synthesiser.
!apps/bootstrapper/fixtures/smoke.wav

